{"id":"bezumno","lemma":"безумно","pos":"adv","rank":1483,"glosses":["madly, awfully","terribly, dreadfully, extremely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это безумно сложно.","en":"It's insanely complex.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"in a complicated manner"}]},{"text":"Знаю, звучит безумно, но клянусь, это правда.","en":"I know it sounds crazy, but I swear it's true.","words":[{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,null,{"g":"but"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"truth (conformity to…"}]},{"text":"Он безумно влюблён в эту девушку.","en":"He is madly in love with that girl.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"in love","l":"влюблённый"},{"g":"in"},null,null]},{"text":"Том будет безумно рад, когда тебя увидит.","en":"Tom will be tickled pink when he sees you.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"glad"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"to see","l":"увидеть"}]},{"text":"Его идеи звучат безумно.","en":"His ideas sound crazy.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"idea, thought, notion","l":"идея"},null,null]}]}